    "name": "Bloodcrave: R18 Prologue",
    "steam_appid": 3051720,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": true,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3051720/extras/e62d027940e033d9d508a19e1c282914.avif?t=1752925531\" width=616 height=201 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to the dark and alluring world of Bloodcrave, a thrilling vampire-themed visual novel that will take you on a journey of love, corruption, and tough choices. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3051720/extras/f96ad577b378dbe50a235daf2f118a14.avif?t=1752925531\" width=588 height=380 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Follow the story of Alex, a young engineer who finds himself in the middle of a battle between vampires and vigilantes. When he is saved by Chloe, a fierce vampire hunter, he discovers that his blood holds a secret that could change the balance of power forever. Will he use his newfound strength to help Chloe rid the city of ruthless vampires, or will he succumb to his dark desires and become a force of destruction? </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3051720/extras/943e0a1e5c279fc559b91d2aac394707.avif?t=1752925531\" width=616 height=201 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you delve deeper into the game, you'll encounter <strong>six captivating love interests</strong>, each with their own unique storylines, personalities, and intimate moments. But be careful, as jealousy can have severe consequences in this world of danger and temptation. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3051720/extras/33983a27a28fb1cd2ae6dfcec073a97d.poster.avif?t=1752925531\" width=600 height=120 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3051720/extras/33983a27a28fb1cd2ae6dfcec073a97d.webm?t=1752925531\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3051720/extras/33983a27a28fb1cd2ae6dfcec073a97d.mp4?t=1752925531\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The decisions</strong> you make will have a drastic impact on the outcome of the game, with multiple endings and epilogues for each character. Will you lead your companions down the path of virtue, or will you make them succumb to the lure of darkness?  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3051720/extras/3e94d978b9e19adcff722925a9da912e.poster.avif?t=1752925531\" width=600 height=120 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3051720/extras/3e94d978b9e19adcff722925a9da912e.webm?t=1752925531\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3051720/extras/3e94d978b9e19adcff722925a9da912e.mp4?t=1752925531\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you <strong>plan your actions</strong> for each day, you'll discover hidden quests, events, and animated scenes that bring this captivating world to life. Immerse yourself in the interactive storytelling, as you decide whether to become a skilled vampire hunter, pursue your love interests, or indulge in something more nefarious.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3051720/extras/017e59ee0ffed9b9a99f1800ac33928d.avif?t=1752925531\" width=616 height=201 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play the first 3 hours of Bloodcrave! You can import saves to the full game!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore romantic relationships with six captivating love interests, each with their own unique branching storylines. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy fully animated voice-acted scenes to immerse yourself in the game's world. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Plan your days carefully by choosing which locations to visit and who to meet, shaping the direction of the story. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Visit over two dozen unique locations, each holding its own secrets and dangers. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Follow the main story with five different endings and discover multiple epilogues for each character, offering satisfying conclusions to their individual story arcs.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3051720/extras/802886102e85efa4ab135a0da5500a0e.avif?t=1752925531\" width=616 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3051720/extras/c56fc697c448ca15041db7ec07ee5fbd.poster.avif?t=1752925531\" width=600 height=310 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3051720/extras/c56fc697c448ca15041db7ec07ee5fbd.webm?t=1752925531\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3051720/extras/c56fc697c448ca15041db7ec07ee5fbd.mp4?t=1752925531\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3051720/extras/e62d027940e033d9d508a19e1c282914.avif?t=1752925531\" width=616 height=201 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to the dark and alluring world of Bloodcrave, a thrilling vampire-themed visual novel that will take you on a journey of love, corruption, and tough choices. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3051720/extras/f96ad577b378dbe50a235daf2f118a14.avif?t=1752925531\" width=588 height=380 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Follow the story of Alex, a young engineer who finds himself in the middle of a battle between vampires and vigilantes. When he is saved by Chloe, a fierce vampire hunter, he discovers that his blood holds a secret that could change the balance of power forever. Will he use his newfound strength to help Chloe rid the city of ruthless vampires, or will he succumb to his dark desires and become a force of destruction? </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3051720/extras/943e0a1e5c279fc559b91d2aac394707.avif?t=1752925531\" width=616 height=201 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you delve deeper into the game, you'll encounter <strong>six captivating love interests</strong>, each with their own unique storylines, personalities, and intimate moments. But be careful, as jealousy can have severe consequences in this world of danger and temptation. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3051720/extras/33983a2