800ac33928d.avif?t=1752925531\" width=616 height=201 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play the first 3 hours of Bloodcrave! You can import saves to the full game!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore romantic relationships with six captivating love interests, each with their own unique branching storylines. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy fully animated voice-acted scenes to immerse yourself in the game's world. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Plan your days carefully by choosing which locations to visit and who to meet, shaping the direction of the story. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Visit over two dozen unique locations, each holding its own secrets and dangers. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Follow the main story with five different endings and discover multiple epilogues for each character, offering satisfying conclusions to their individual story arcs.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3051720/extras/802886102e85efa4ab135a0da5500a0e.avif?t=1752925531\" width=616 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3051720/extras/c56fc697c448ca15041db7ec07ee5fbd.poster.avif?t=1752925531\" width=600 height=310 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3051720/extras/c56fc697c448ca15041db7ec07ee5fbd.webm?t=1752925531\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3051720/extras/c56fc697c448ca15041db7ec07ee5fbd.mp4?t=1752925531\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul>",
